# T_SCRE: the empty contents of a location, and that location deleted; a
# location moved with Move into another chosen from the pick list, a
# letter jumping to it; a room's contents, which start with everything
# below it, as the room holds other locations, then of that only the
# top-level items, then those of the room alone; a location found by its
# first letter, renamed, a line typed into its notes (which the form at
# level 2 always opens for editing), and saved.
K DOWN ENTER
S EMPTY
K ESC DEL
T Y
S DELE1
K END ALT-C M
S MOVEPICK
T G
K ENTER
S MOVED
K HOME DOWN ENTER
S BELOW
K ALT-C Y
S TOPBELOW
K ALT-C G
S TOPHERE
K ESC
T C
K CTRL-E CTRL-Y
T Cabinet of drawers
K PGDN F4
T Top shelf.
S LOCMEMO
K CTRL-S
S MEMOSAVE
K CTRL-S
S LOCSAVED
K ESC
